{"id":"longest-repeating-character-replacement","title":"Longest Repeating Character Replacement","topic":"06-two-pointers-sliding-window","difficulty":"medium","points":20,"lc":424,"tags":["sliding window","string"],"statement":{"hi":"String `s` (sirf uppercase English letters) aur integer `k` diye hain. Tum kisi bhi character ko kisi aur uppercase letter se badal sakte ho, zyada se zyada `k` baar. Aisa karne ke baad sabse lambi substring ki length return karo jisme saare letters same hon.","en":"Given a string `s` of uppercase English letters and an integer `k`, you may change any character to any other uppercase letter at most `k` times. Return the length of the longest substring containing only one repeated letter after these operations."},"constraints":["1 ≤ s.length ≤ 10^5","s consists of only uppercase English letters","0 ≤ k ≤ s.length"],"hints":{"hi":["Ek window valid hai agar `window length - sabse frequent letter ki count ≤ k`.","Window ko right se badhao; invalid ho jaaye to left se ek step sikodo."],"en":["A window is valid if `window length - count of its most frequent letter ≤ k`.","Grow the window on the right; when it becomes invalid, shrink it from the left by one step."]},"signature":{"fn":"characterReplacement","params":[{"name":"s","type":"string"},{"name":"k","type":"int"}],"ret":"int"},"compare":"exact","starter":"class Solution {\npublic:\n    int characterReplacement(string& s, int k) {\n        \n    }\n};\n","examples":[{"args":["ABAB",2],"expected":4,"explain":{"hi":"Dono A ko B (ya dono B ko A) bana do: \"BBBB\", length 4.","en":"Replace the two A's with B (or vice versa): \"BBBB\", length 4."}},{"args":["AABABBA",1],"expected":4,"explain":{"hi":"Beech wala A ko B banao: \"AABBBBA\" me \"BBBB\" length 4.","en":"Replace the middle A with B: \"AABBBBA\" contains \"BBBB\", length 4."}}],"tests":[{"args":["ABAB",2],"expected":4},{"args":["AABABBA",1],"expected":4},{"args":["A",0],"expected":1},{"args":["A",1],"expected":1},{"args":["ABCDE",0],"expected":1},{"args":["ABCDE",5],"expected":5},{"args":["AAAA",0],"expected":4},{"args":["ABBB",2],"expected":4},{"args":["BAAAB",2],"expected":5},{"args":["",1],"expected":17},{"args":["ADBFD",3],"expected":5},{"args":["FEDABDB",1],"expected":3},{"args":["",3],"expected":15},{"args":["ABCCDFFF",0],"expected":3},{"args":["GBFDAEAECFAA",7],"expected":11},{"args":["",3],"expected":13},{"args":["BBBB",3],"expected":4},{"args":["ABCCBAB",1],"expected":3},{"args":["",986],"expected":1032},{"args":["",3],"expected":7},{"args":["GB",2],"expected":2},{"args":["",0],"expected":8},{"args":["CBFECBECBCEFBFFGADAGCBBCABEBGDCGFFEGEEDGCFGBFGDBDCFFGCEECEFGAEDDFGFGCGAGDDGFAEBDCAGGBBEFFCBCCGEEBEBGECDDBBACGCDAGABDFECBFEGABFBECFBDAEFCBEGGGACBGAEDDGDEBFECDDGCAGCDAGFFFAFCFBEECDGACAADEFFCBDCEGDADEBCEADBFBGDFEDG",0],"expected":3},{"args":["BACBBBACABBA",4],"expected":9},{"args":["DBCGBFDBAA",7],"expected":10},{"args":["",0],"expected":2},{"args":["",2],"expected":5},{"args":["ACVQWAMACCUAIONXFAXJOYCVDNDPEYEDCGM",2],"expected":4},{"args":["",1],"expected":4},{"args":["ABBBB",1],"expected":5},{"args":["BCBCACBCBACB",12],"expected":12},{"args":["",0],"expected":2},{"args":["CCACBCCCCCCBBABCBAAABBBCABCBACCCAABABBBBCCCBABACCCBCBCCACCABACACCCBBACCAACCACABACBCCBBCABAABCBCAACCBCABBACBAABAABABACABABACABABCBACCCBBCACA",2],"expected":11},{"args":["FGAAAADBDC",1],"expected":5},{"args":["",3],"expected":10}],"solution":{"approach":{"hi":"Sliding window + 26 size count array. `maxf` = window me ab tak ki sabse badi frequency. Agar `window length - maxf > k` ho to left se ek char hatao (window kabhi chhoti nahi hoti, sirf slide hoti hai). `maxf` ko ghatane ki zaroorat nahi kyunki answer sirf bada `maxf` milne pe badhta hai. O(n) time, O(1) space.","en":"Sliding window + a 26-entry count array. `maxf` = the highest frequency seen in a window so far. If `window length - maxf > k`, drop one char from the left (the window never shrinks, it only slides). `maxf` never needs to decrease, because the answer only grows when a larger `maxf` appears. O(n) time, O(1) space."},"cpp":"class Solution {\npublic:\n    int characterReplacement(string s, int k) {\n        int cnt[26] = {0};\n        int l = 0, maxf = 0, best = 0;\n        for (int r = 0; r < (int)s.size(); r++) {\n            maxf = max(maxf, ++cnt[s[r] - 'A']);\n            if (r - l + 1 - maxf > k) {\n                cnt[s[l] - 'A']--;\n                l++;\n            }\n            best = max(best, r - l + 1);\n        }\n        return best;\n    }\n};"}}